        {
          "tile_id": "kpi-consolidation-days",
          "type": "chart",
          "title": "Branch-Days to Consolidate",
          "datasources": [
            "ds-route-kpis"
          ],
          "spec": {
            "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
            "data": {
              "name": "values"
            },
            "usermeta": {
              "snowflake": {
                "chartType": "scorecard",
                "scorecardConfig": {
                  "currentColumn": "CONSOLIDATION_DAYS",
                  "labelField": "",
                  "format": "number",
                  "decimals": 0,
                  "abbreviate": false,
                  "deltaColorMode": "decreasesBetter",
                  "comparisonMode": "manual",
                  "comparisonEnabled": false,
                  "sparklineEnabled": false,
                  "labelEnabled": false
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "tile_id": "route-recommendations",
          "type": "text",
          "title": "Recommendations",
          "text": "### Route optimization opportunities\n\nBased on Jan–Jun 2024 data:\n\n- **Consolidate light routes.** 844 of 3,900 routes (22%) had 7 or fewer planned stops, against an average of about 10. On 157 branch-days, a branch ran two or more of these light routes on the same day. Those are the clearest candidates to merge. Start with **BR-010** (21 such days), **BR-004** and **BR-008** (20 each).\n- **Fix reliability at BR-003.** Its late or missed rate is **16.1%**, compared with 10.3% at BR-004. Three of the four drivers with the most late or missed stops (DRV-0022, DRV-0012, DRV-0002) are based there. Review their route sequencing and stop density before adding capacity.\n- **Prioritize restock and pump-out windows.** Restock has the most late stops (144), and pump-out and cleaning have the most missed stops (88 and 87). Schedule these earlier in the route or give them dedicated time windows.\n- **Weekday balance is fine.** Each weekday averages about 10 planned stops per route, so rebalancing across days won't help. Focus on consolidating routes within a day."
        },
        {
          "tile_id": "light-routes-by-branch",
          "type": "chart",
          "title": "Light Routes & Consolidation Days by Branch",
          "datasources": [
            "ds-branch-routes"
          ],
          "spec": {
            "transform": [
              {
                "fold": [
                  "LIGHT_ROUTES",
                  "CONSOLIDATION_DAYS"
                ],
                "as": [
                  "MEASURE",
                  "VALUE"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "mark": "bar",
            "encoding": {
              "x": {
                "field": "BRANCH_ID",
                "type": "nominal",
                "title": "Branch"
              },
              "xOffset": {
                "field": "MEASURE",
                "type": "nominal"
              },
              "y": {
                "field": "VALUE",
                "type": "quantitative",
                "title": "Count"
              },
              "color": {
                "field": "MEASURE",
                "type": "nominal",
                "title": "Measure"
              },
              "tooltip": [
                {
                  "field": "BRANCH_ID",
                  "type": "nominal"
                },
                {
                  "field": "MEASURE",
                  "type": "nominal"
                },
                {
                  "field": "VALUE",
                  "type": "quantitative"
                },
                {
                  "field": "AVG_STOPS_PER_ROUTE",
                  "type": "quantitative",
                  "format": ".2f"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "tile_id": "late-rate-by-branch",
          "type": "chart",
          "title": "Late/Missed Rate by Branch",
          "datasources": [
            "ds-branch-late"
          ],
          "spec": {
            "mark": "bar",
            "encoding": {
              "x": {
                "field": "BRANCH_ID",
                "type": "nominal",
